# Pairs with ListedInSink. A retire does not wait for a publish of its scope
# that holds the id, and deletes the manifest of the row that publish
# registers.
MODULE: ListedInSinkRetireIgnoresPublish
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a retire starts while a publish of its scope holds the id
PERTURBS: RetireStart

--- FIND
    /\ held["A"] = "free"
    /\ ~Leased
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT !["A"] = "ret"]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no wait on a publish's hold.
    /\ ~Leased
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT !["A"] = "ret"]
--- END
